OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry bright morning
OL,6,Fcloud and rain will spread east in the
OL,7,Fafternoon, rain will be intermittent
OL,8,Fand mostly light, some areas in north
OL,9,FAberdeenshire staying dry, quite
OL,10,Fbreezy again.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain dying out and cloud
OL,13,Fbreaking with the chance of some
OL,14,Fevening sun towards Aberdeen. clear
OL,15,Fspells overnight, a few showers
OL,16,Fperhaps reaching the west, windy at
OL,17,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
