OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FBright and breezy with
OL,6,Foccasional showers in the morning,
OL,7,Fespecially for Upper Deeside, mostly
OL,8,Fdry towards Aberdeen and north
OL,9,FAberdeenshire. Fresh winds at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,12,Fdry on Sunday and less windy than
OL,13,Fprevious days, unsettled on Monday and
OL,14,FTuesday with some rain but also some
OL,15,Fbrighter weather.
